From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Sat, 13 Sep 2026 14:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] spacemit-k3: fix RCPU1 reserved-memory overlap warning

Since the OpenSBI bump to k3-br-v1.0.7 (which first added RCPU PMP protection
in platform/generic/spacemit/spacemit_k3.c - it did not exist in 1.0.0), Linux
logs at boot:

  OF: reserved mem: OVERLAP DETECTED!
  rcpu1_runtime@100800000 overlaps with mmode_resv5@1,800000
  mmode_resv5@1,800000 overlaps with rcpu1_heap@100a00000

OpenSBI PMP-protects the RCPU runtime areas (sbi_domain_root_add_memrange,
ENF_PERMISSIONS) and injects an "mmode_resv" no-map node per region into the DT.
The kernel deduplicates injected nodes that exactly coincide with an existing
reserved-memory node, but warns on partial overlaps.

RCPU0 (size 0x400000, base 0x100200000 - NOT 0x400000 aligned) is emitted as two
2 MiB regions that exactly match rcpu0_pwr and rcpu0_heap - silent. RCPU1 (size
0x400000, base 0x100800000 - IS 0x400000 aligned) has its two 2 MiB regions
coalesced by root_add_memregion() into a single 4 MiB region (the merge only
triggers when the lower base is aligned to twice the size), which then straddles
the two 2 MiB kernel-DT nodes rcpu1_runtime (@0x100800000) and rcpu1_heap
(@0x100a00000) - hence mmode_resv5 and the warning. Changing the granule does
not help: the merge re-coalesces it.

Protect only the 2 MiB RCPU1 runtime block. OpenSBI then emits a single 2 MiB
region that exactly matches rcpu1_runtime and is deduplicated by the kernel, so
no overlap is reported. The RCPU1 firmware runtime stays PMP-protected; the heap
keeps its kernel-DT "no-map" reservation (as it already did on k3-br-v1.0.0,
which had no OpenSBI RCPU protection at all). RCPU1 remoteproc attach is
unaffected.

Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
---
 platform/generic/include/spacemit/k3/k3.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/platform/generic/include/spacemit/k3/k3.h b/platform/generic/include/spacemit/k3/k3.h
--- a/platform/generic/include/spacemit/k3/k3.h
+++ b/platform/generic/include/spacemit/k3/k3.h
@@ -108,7 +108,7 @@
 #define RCPU0_RUNTIME_SPACE_BASE_ADDR	(0x100200000UL)
 #define RCPU0_RUNTIME_SPACE_SIZE	(0x400000UL)
 #define RCPU1_RUNTIME_SPACE_BASE_ADDR	(0x100800000UL)
-#define RCPU1_RUNTIME_SPACE_SIZE	(0x400000UL)
+#define RCPU1_RUNTIME_SPACE_SIZE	(0x200000UL)
 #define RCPU_DTB_SPACE_BASE_ADDR	(0x100d00000UL)
 #define RCPU_DTB_SPACEMI_SIZE		(0x100000UL)
 #define REGISTER_PRESERVATION_BASE	(0xd4282000)
